#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:2 8e6bd322fdef4fddbf93c9abcea0ff0d
msgid "FileSaveHook"
msgstr "文件保存钩子"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:4 70fa219e786c47a9a260397a157d97b9
msgid "**File-based output processing and archiving**"
msgstr "**基于文件的输出处理与归档**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:6 d03e37e1f7804092abd7bc5dbe597aa5
msgid ""
"The FileSaveHook saves tool outputs to temporary files and returns file "
"information instead of the original output. This is ideal for handling "
"large outputs or when you need to process outputs as files."
msgstr ""
"FileSaveHook "
"将工具输出保存到临时文件中，并返回文件信息，而非原始输出内容。此方法非常适合处理大容量输出或需要将输出作为文件进行处理的场景。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:9 bdbdb846c70e4c899c6700446d9cd638
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:11 b3328007e793463cb2a319df1c80de71
msgid ""
"**What it does:** - Saves tool outputs to temporary files - Analyzes data"
" format and structure automatically - Returns file metadata (path, size, "
"format, structure) - Supports automatic cleanup of old files"
msgstr ""
"**功能说明：**  \n"
"- 将工具输出保存到临时文件  \n"
"- 自动分析数据格式和结构  \n"
"- 返回文件元数据（路径、大小、格式、结构）  \n"
"- 支持自动清理旧文件"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:17 dc6b7b1ce6d343b7b7aa1a0d669b8151
msgid ""
"**When to use:** - Very large outputs that exceed memory limits - "
"Processing outputs as files for external tools - Archiving tool outputs "
"for later analysis - Reducing memory usage in long-running processes"
msgstr ""
"**使用场景：**  \n"
"- 输出数据量非常大，超出内存限制时  \n"
"- 将输出作为文件供外部工具处理时  \n"
"- 归档工具输出以便后续分析时  \n"
"- 在长时间运行的进程中减少内存使用时"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:24 555be29c1ab04e6791619df3d8135f02
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:26 3d5f6c048f2b430dad10decf99408db3
msgid "**Simple Usage**"
msgstr "**简单使用方法**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:46 bb45d96007bc49f5ba78e005540cd798
msgid "**Advanced Configuration**"
msgstr "**高级配置**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:74 532d9b3b7f5945169f567c25226a6590
msgid "Configuration Options"
msgstr "配置选项"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:76 a1bb7ea942a7482da7b71d56d6d34755
msgid ""
"**Temp Directory** - Directory where files are saved - Default: System "
"temporary directory - Use absolute paths for custom locations"
msgstr "**临时目录** - 文件保存的目录 - 默认：系统临时目录 - 自定义位置请使用绝对路径"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:81 197415cbc1fe41929829af7023cf0d8f
msgid ""
"**File Prefix** - Prefix for generated filenames - Default: "
"\"tool_output\" - Helps organize files by purpose"
msgstr "**文件前缀** - 生成文件名的前缀 - 默认值：\"tool_output\" - 有助于按用途组织文件"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:86 deb3760db5fe4afc8288375bbea0bddf
msgid ""
"**Include Metadata** - Whether to include file metadata in response - "
"Default: True - Provides file information and context"
msgstr "**包含元数据** - 是否在响应中包含文件元数据 - 默认值：True - 提供文件信息和上下文"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:91 01ebade2c1384d648f4aff676e414853
msgid ""
"**Auto Cleanup** - Automatically remove old files - Default: False - "
"Helps manage disk space"
msgstr "**自动清理** - 自动删除旧文件 - 默认值：False - 有助于管理磁盘空间"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:96 7a0e5075caa84dd1a3aa435e8d1c2b66
msgid ""
"**Cleanup Age Hours** - Age threshold for automatic cleanup - Default: 24"
" hours - Files older than this are removed"
msgstr "**清理时长（小时）** - 自动清理的时间阈值 - 默认值：24 小时 - 超过该时长的文件将被删除"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:102 61c7fa5960c743679203a696fe9445b7
msgid "Data Format Detection"
msgstr "数据格式检测"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:104 1cc67e02b9874bbcba695fcb874935aa
msgid "The hook automatically detects and handles different data types:"
msgstr "该钩子能够自动检测并处理不同的数据类型："

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:106 0c8c6a471c7e4dd9b7e5dba0fb8df70b
msgid ""
"**JSON Data** - Dictionaries, lists, JSON strings - Saved as `.json` "
"files - Structure: \"dict with X keys\", \"list with X items\""
msgstr ""
"**JSON 数据** - 字典、列表、JSON 字符串 - 以 `.json` 文件保存 - 结构：“包含 X 个键的字典”、“包含 X "
"个元素的列表”"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:111 5c404da2b3344627acf533808a391b80
msgid ""
"**Text Data** - Plain text, strings - Saved as `.txt` files - Structure: "
"\"text\", \"string\""
msgstr "**文本数据** - 纯文本，字符串 - 以 `.txt` 文件保存 - 结构：“text”，“string”"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:116 178610011c0446c7a0dabcac9aad0e9f
msgid ""
"**Binary Data** - Non-text data - Saved as `.bin` files - Structure: "
"\"binary\", \"data\""
msgstr "**二进制数据** - 非文本数据 - 以 `.bin` 文件保存 - 结构：“binary”，“data”"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:121 d075ca66fb794a9d9f4eca94bcf5efdc
msgid ""
"**Other Formats** - Custom data types - Saved with appropriate extensions"
" - Structure: \"custom\", \"unknown\""
msgstr "**其他格式** - 自定义数据类型 - 以相应扩展名保存 - 结构：\"custom\"、\"unknown\""

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:127 3d38a14ac7d949109ec430cac344d9c7
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:129 a68593f979574e049a7d7e6bc70ce9b4
msgid "**Large Dataset Processing**"
msgstr "**大规模数据集处理**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:153 7ceaa66a5ffd468590719b8fdf127cd2
msgid "**Custom Directory and Cleanup**"
msgstr "**自定义目录与清理**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:177 03b4ef42953e42e6a7c17d23c3fae256
msgid "**External Tool Integration**"
msgstr "**外部工具集成**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:197 eb11d4f83dbd4ccab163c71d15389960
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:199 5262492b03d743fd9d261f95c50da75d
msgid ""
"**File Permission Errors** - Ensure directory exists and is writable - "
"Check file permissions and ownership - Use absolute paths for temp "
"directories"
msgstr "**文件权限错误** - 确保目录存在且可写 - 检查文件权限和所有权 - 对临时目录使用绝对路径"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:204 7dfebcf3f9b045919ef976255aead713
msgid ""
"**Memory Issues** - Use FileSaveHook for large outputs - Enable auto-"
"cleanup for temporary files - Monitor disk space usage"
msgstr "**内存问题** - 对于大输出使用 FileSaveHook - 启用临时文件自动清理 - 监控磁盘空间使用情况"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:209 4a638d004b5c44c6b0e05f0042a31fad
msgid ""
"**Hook Not Triggering** - Check trigger conditions and thresholds - "
"Verify hook configuration and enabled status - Review hook priority "
"settings"
msgstr "**钩子未触发** - 检查触发条件和阈值 - 验证钩子配置及启用状态 - 审核钩子优先级设置"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:214 431ebffc447c4515a898b57136063e86
msgid ""
"**Performance Problems** - Use tool-specific hooks instead of global "
"hooks - Set appropriate thresholds to avoid unnecessary processing - "
"Monitor hook execution times"
msgstr ""
"**性能问题**  \n"
"- 使用特定工具的钩子，避免使用全局钩子  \n"
"- 设置适当的阈值以避免不必要的处理  \n"
"- 监控钩子执行时间"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:219 5087518690fc4bf081c65a9ef503ee82
msgid "**Debugging**"
msgstr "**调试**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/file_save_hook.rst:221 c9bcefdfe8fe48e693a97bdb6425d7a8
